    "question_text": "<p>In the scheme given below, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">X</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Y</mi></math>, respectively, are</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>Metal&#160;halide</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>.&#160;</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></mrow></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>&#160;White&#160;precipitate</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>Filtrate</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">&#160;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">&#160;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">&#160;</mo><munder><mover><mrow><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><msub><mi>PbO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>excess</mi><mo>)&#160;</mo></mrow></mover><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">&#160;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"bold\">&#160;</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>.&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mover><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>heat</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mtext>a&#160;coloured&#160;species&#160;in&#160;solution</mtext></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mrow><mi>MnO</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Conc</mi><mo>.</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mover><mrow